<view class="login-page"><view class="login-card card"><view class="brand-lockup"><image class="brand-image" src="/assets/brand/logo-light.png" mode="widthFix"/></view><view class="login-title">大学生的 AI 求职搭子</view><view class="subtitle">简历怎么写，面试怎么说。</view><view class="section-title">{{register?'创建账号':'欢迎回来'}}</view><view class="muted small">与 Web 端使用同一个账号，资料和积分同步。</view><text class="label">用户名</text><input class="field" value="{{username}}" bindinput="onUsername" maxlength="32" placeholder="输入用户名" disabled="{{loading}}"/><text class="label">密码</text><input class="field" value="{{password}}" bindinput="onPassword" password maxlength="128" placeholder="输入密码（至少 12 位）" disabled="{{loading}}"/><block wx:if="{{register}}"><text class="label">确认密码</text><input class="field" value="{{confirmation}}" bindinput="onConfirmation" password maxlength="128" placeholder="再次输入密码"/></block><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="primary submit" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="submit" hover-class="tap">{{register?'注册账号':'登录'}}</button><button wx:if="{{registrationEnabled}}" class="quiet" bindtap="toggleMode" disabled="{{loading}}">{{register?'已有账号，去登录':'还没有账号？注册'}}</button></view><view class="muted small login-footer">简面职说 · 陪你准备下一次机会</view></view>
